# Raw tick-level JSONL is large (~1.6 MB per run x 210 runs = ~430 MB) and
# deterministic under the seeds recorded in stage_a_run.py, so it is not
# tracked. Regenerate any subset locally with:
#
#   uv run python experiments/phase5_od8_h7/STEP1_MECHANISM/stage_a_run.py
#
# and analyse with:
#
#   uv run python experiments/phase5_od8_h7/STEP1_MECHANISM/stage_a_analyse.py
#
# The committed evidence for what each seed did lives in
# ../processed_results/per_run_summary_<suffix>.json, which is the only file
# a reviewer needs to reproduce the mechanism verdict without re-running the
# sweep.
*.jsonl
manifest.csv
run_summary.json
